cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this interface, please cite it as below, together with NewtonX and Q-Chem."
title: "NewtonX-Q-Chem interface for EOM-CCSD surface hopping"
abstract: "A NewtonX 2.x interface (run-qchem-eom.pl) to Q-Chem equation-of-motion coupled-cluster methods (EOM-IP, EOM-EA, EOM-EE and EOM-SF-CCSD) for trajectory surface hopping, with nonadiabatic coupling vectors or time-dependent Baeck-An couplings."
type: software
